{"id": "EUVD-2026-101575", "enisaUuid": "1819f97d-370a-3090-8d62-1f8f091ea37b", "description": "Nexent through 2.7.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in check_file_access that allows authenticated users to read other tenants' knowledge-base files by skipping tenant comparison for knowledge_base/ reads. Attackers in multi-tenant deployments can list objects via GET /file/storage for presigned URLs or use GET /file/download/{object_name} to download other tenants' source documents.", "datePublished": "2026-10-14T18:48:05", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T17:15:27", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/nexent-knowledge-base-cross-tenant-file-read", "https://github.com/ModelEngine-Group/nexent/blob/90bf1a5dbb1eb16bb4a28c2407ed4b6eda9a09bf/backend/services/file_management_service.py#L177", "https://github.com/ModelEngine-Group/nexent", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nexent-through-2.7.0-cross-tenant-knowledge-base-file-read-via-check-file-access"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-110775", "GHSA-7qhg-85q3-m2xj"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.25, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "c6a373cf-2ace-31ad-9be2-0b0541e6f320", "product": {"name": "nexent", "vendor": {"name": "ModelEngine-Group"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "75d42c5a-971b-37b8-85b5-f10d978e3733", "vendor": {"name": "ModelEngine-Group"}}], "isExploited": false}